# Folder and naming conventions

## Layout (`frontend/src`)

| Folder | Use for |
|--------|---------|
| `api/` | Query keys, fetchers, API types |
| `hooks/` | React hooks, including Query wrappers |
| `stores/` | Zustand stores |
| `components/` | Shared UI grouped by domain; `components/ui/` = ShadCN primitives (keep generator names) |
| `pages/` | Route screens (`*Page.tsx`) |
| `types/` | Shared domain / API TypeScript types only |
| `lib/` | Shared helpers (`queryClient`, `utils`) |
| `test/` | Vitest setup only |

### `components/` groups

| Folder | Use for |
|--------|---------|
| `layout/` | App shell (sidebar, header, toaster, page header) |
| `alerts/` | Alerts list / empty / row UI |
| `timeRange/` | Shared time-range picker and badge |
| `dashboard/` | BTC price chart (`PriceChart` entry + `price/`, `controls/`, `viewport/`, `lib/`) |
| `charts/` | Shared chart UI helpers (placeholders, etc.) |
| `examples/` | Scaffold demos (e.g. Query patterns) |
| `ui/` | ShadCN primitives only |

Also under `frontend/e2e/`:
- `ui-integration/` — Playwright **UI integration** (FE-only)
- `system/` — Playwright **E2E** (APIs/services when available)

Different strategy from Vitest **unit** tests under `src/` — never put UI integration/E2E in `src/` or run them with Vitest.

## Component file rules (required)

1. **One function component per file.** Each React function component is the single primary export of its own `.tsx` file. Do not define helper/child components in the same file as another component — extract them.
2. **File name matches the component name** (`AppSidebarNavItem.tsx` → `export function AppSidebarNavItem`).
3. **Group related components in subfolders** under `components/` (camelCase folder names). When several components belong to the same feature/UI concern, put them in a shared folder — do not leave a flat pile in `components/`.
4. **Nest further when a group grows.** If a domain folder has multiple clear clusters, add subfolders (e.g. `dashboard/price/`, `dashboard/controls/`, `dashboard/viewport/`, `dashboard/lib/`). Keep a clear public entry at the domain root when useful (`dashboard/PriceChart.tsx`).
5. **Do not** use one-folder-per-component with `index.tsx` (`TimeRangePicker/index.tsx`).
6. **Exception:** leave `components/ui/*` as ShadCN generates them (may export multiple primitives per file).

## Shared types (required)

- Put **shared domain and API types** under `src/types/` (camelCase files, e.g. `types/chart.ts`, `types/alerts.ts`, `types/btcPriceHistory.ts`).
- Import shared types from `@/types/...` — do not declare/export shared types from `api/`, `stores/`, `hooks/`, `constants/`, or component modules.
- Local component `Props` types may stay private in the component file (not exported).
- Runtime values (constants, functions, stores) stay in their domain folders; only the type aliases/interfaces move to `types/`.

## Naming (TypeScript / React)

- **Components & pages:** PascalCase files matching the export (`TimeRangePicker.tsx`, `DashboardPage.tsx`).
- **Hooks:** camelCase with `use` prefix (`useBtcPriceHistoryQuery.ts`, `useCreateExampleItemMutation.ts`).
- **Modules** (api, stores, lib, utils): camelCase (`btcPriceHistory.ts`, `preferencesStore.ts`, `queryClient.ts`).
- One primary export per file; component export name matches the file name.
- Tests: co-located `*.test.ts(x)`; helpers: `*.testHelpers.ts(x)`.
- UI integration: `*.spec.ts` + co-located `*.specHelpers.ts` under `e2e/ui-integration/` (named act/expect helpers; arrange → act → assert).
- Prefer TypeScript-style names above; do not introduce kebab-case app modules.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — two components in one file
export function AlertsList() { /* ... */ }
function AlertListItem() { /* ... */ }

// ❌ BAD — flat unrelated pile / kebab-case / index.tsx wrapper
src/components/AlertListItem.tsx
src/components/TimeRangePicker.tsx
src/components/time-range-picker.tsx
src/components/TimeRangePicker/index.tsx

// ✅ GOOD — one component per file, related pieces in a group folder
src/components/alerts/AlertsList.tsx
src/components/alerts/AlertListItem.tsx
src/components/alerts/AlertsEmptyState.tsx
src/components/timeRange/TimeRangePicker.tsx
src/components/dashboard/PriceChart.tsx
src/components/dashboard/price/PriceLineChart.tsx
src/components/dashboard/controls/ChartTypeSwitcher.tsx
src/hooks/useBtcPriceHistoryQuery.ts
src/api/btcPriceHistory.ts
```
